<title>USA: Complete Management year shr up at $0.66.</title>
<headline>Complete Management year shr up at $0.66.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Management Inc</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						   Year ended December 31</p>
<p>					  Actual    Pro-forma    Actual</p>
<p>					    1996	1995(a)	1995</p>
<p> Gross revenues			   33,158   19,581    12,294</p>
<p>Income before provisions for income</p>
<p>  taxes				     10,293    7,186     6,088</p>
<p> Net income				  5,414    3,605     3,227</p>
<p>Earnings per share - primary</p>
<p>						  0.68     0.48	1.08</p>
<p>			  fully diluted     0.66	  -	   -</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding -	     primary    8,008    7,438     2,981</p>
<p>			  fully diluted   10,087	  -	   -</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) 1995 pro-forma results reflect merger of Medical Management Inc intocompany and initial public offering of company's common stock, as if transactions had occurred January 1, 1995, even though both closed January 3, 1996.</p>
<p>1995 pro-forma results do not include operations of acquisitions and mergers made during the six months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
